<title>POLAND: DOM-PLAST SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOM-PLAST SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.95 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.40 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Sales		    6.94 vs   6.85</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.06 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.36 vs   5.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.89 vs   6.34</p>
<p> Sales		   54.44 vs  59.76</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is</p>
<p>Dom-Plast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
